            {
              "content": "Return exactly one valid JSON object and nothing else: no markdown, no code fences, no text before or after. It must parse with JSON.parse. Each string value under 15 words, single line. If a value would contain a double quote, rephrase to avoid it.\nTITLE: {{240.title}}\nEXCERPT: {{substring(240.description; 0; 900)}}\nSOURCE: official U.S. FDA press release. If it announces an approval, authorization or clearance of a new drug, biologic, gene/cell therapy, vaccine or device, or a first-of-its-kind treatment, set priority to high (breaking if it is the first therapy for a disease or a new mechanism) and category to pharma regulation or clinical catalyst.\n\nSchema (all string values):\ncategory: one of [market access, drug pricing, pharma regulation, M&A, clinical catalyst, oncology, manufacturing, digital health, ai healthcare, payer systems, public health, litigation, health systems & disease burden]\ncountry: single country name or Global\ncompany: main institution or company\nangle: one affirmative sentence\nwhy_it_matters: one sentence\npatients_impact: one sentence\nindustry_impact: one sentence\nlitigation_risk: low, medium or high\npriority: breaking, high, medium or low",
              "inputType": "single",
              "role": "user"
            }
          ],
          "model": "claude-fable-5"
        },
